                    "The life expectancy of Egypt is higher than the life expectancy of Mexico",
                    "The life expectancy of Mexico is higher than the life expectancy of Brazil", 
                    "The life expectancy of China is lower than the life expectancy of Mexico",
                    "The life expectancy of Norway and the life expectancy of Brazil have the same value",
                    "Skip"]
